{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19188","headline":"和令狐相公言怀寄河中杨少尹 · 刘禹锡","name":"和令狐相公言怀寄河中杨少尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"章句慙非第一流，世间才子昔陪游。\n吴宫已叹芙蓉死，边月空悲芦管秋。\n任向洛阳称傲吏，苦教河上领诸侯。\n石渠甘对图书老，关外杨公安稳不。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}